    actor: 'Yoweri Museveni and the NRM; executive, Parliament, courts, Electoral Commission, UPDF, police and other security institutions; National Unity Platform and other opposition parties; civil society, media, NGOs, women, youth, persons with disabilities and older-person representatives; kingdoms and cultural institutions; voters; and AU–COMESA–IGAD observers and EU diplomatic actors',
    historicalSetting: 'Uganda’s 2021 post-election late-Museveni order, the 2025/2026 electoral administration and campaigns, the 15 January 2026 presidential and parliamentary election, and the staggered local-government and special-interest electoral horizon',
    startYear: 2021,
