    actor: 'Fumio Kishida, Shigeru Ishiba and Sanae Takaichi and their cabinets; LDP factions, Komeito and the Japan Innovation Party; the National Diet, Cabinet Legislation Bureau, Ministry of Internal Affairs and Communications, courts and election administration; Constitutional Democratic/Centrist Reform Alliance, Democratic Party for the People, Sanseito, Team Mirai, Japanese Communist and other opposition parties; media, civil-society, labor, women’s, youth, regional, Ainu, Okinawan, Zainichi and migrant actors; and the United States and other alliance and regional partners',
    historicalSetting: 'Japan’s 31 October 2021 House election; the 2023–2024 LDP factional political-funds controversy, June 2024 reform response and 27 October 2024 House election; the July 2025 House of Councillors election and governing-side losses; the October 2025 change from the LDP–Komeito framework to LDP–Japan Innovation Party cooperation and Takaichi’s designation; the 8 February 2026 snap House election and 18 February Diet meeting; and the reshuffled cabinet inaugurated in September 2026',
